message.content:
{"diagnosis": "Fetch makes no progress (max_addr=0x00000000, FAIL 0xdead) vs expected sequential advance through 256-word NOP mem. Both reg_pc and reg_next_pc are assigned current_pc in excerpt, so next fetch reuses same address and PC never increments. Root cause is missing PC increment on reg_next_pc; fix uses compressed_instr already in excerpt for 2/4-byte step.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1526,4 +1526,4 @@
 				reg_pc <= current_pc;
-				reg_next_pc <= current_pc;
+				reg_next_pc <= current_pc + (compressed_instr ? 2 : 4);
 				latched_store <= 0;
 				latched_stalu <= 0;", "expected": "tohost PASS max_addr=0x000003fc, no FAIL 0xdead, progress through NOP mem"}

